{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "aa5a7f773d9929e1a68a2f5caf56a819f8de52bd211d27f08705faa3f9c81955", "ja": "（映画『リリィ・ナイトと天空の騎士団』の上映会が\n終わり、劇場も穏やかさを取り戻しつつある……）", "zh": "（电影《莉莉骑士与天空骑士团》的放映会结束了，剧场也逐渐恢复了平静……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8ef25090db66a3a314598b3731e76763efa6f3f1d59cb3471010c94fc06bbceb", "ja": "おっ、ロコ！　お疲れさま。\nこの前の応援上映、大成功だったな。", "zh": "哦，ROCO！辛苦了。\n上次的应援观影会大获成功啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "f0dcd41825e63e24ffd9f47e5b941be8b80dc31d0bd73f98b2aa5b76e7bd85b3", "ja": "{$P$}！　お疲れさまです。\nふふふ、ロコもがんばりましたからね♪", "zh": "{$P$}！辛苦了。\n呵呵呵，因为ROCO也很努力了嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a2ca2d5b3e3e8af99aaffc0cbfa538de189fd328bbf5763fb21b7ce55f4e9936", "ja": "お陰で、いい劇場の宣伝にもなったよ。\nロコの村人役も、かなり人気があったよな。", "zh": "多亏了你，也给剧场做了很好的宣传。\nROCO的村民角色也相当受欢迎呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "4d90132dcbe43493dd42cd34cc14dc2be3eb0d6709ee971f6cfc628b60c72395", "ja": "ディファレントです！\nロコはビレッジピーポーではないですよ？", "zh": "不一样！\nROCO才不是村民吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "6af898fd366b91c128276bcdfe62a6f0b1a5ee6d65258a8863206938c7f967b8", "ja": "ビレッジピーポーと、ブラックスミスと、\n迷子のチルドレンA。あとエンシェントピーポー……。", "zh": "村民、铁匠、迷路的孩子A。还有远古人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "787efc17f3dae61e716f2482d1c04a066e3cdc723bf07c73c046d743f929700a", "ja": "それにフェアリーピーポーAに、\n秘密の行商人A、ええと……とにかくたくさんです！", "zh": "还有精灵人A、秘密的行商人A，呃……总之有很多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c861e52f7c9e33b8742ab9b65bfdf9d69b9e3820c2703ebfd8e46368006c350c", "ja": "あ、ああ、そうだったな……。\n撮影のときは、大変そうだったよな。", "zh": "啊、啊，对，是这样……。\n拍摄的时候确实挺辛苦的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "011c933f551849432c132a04ef1e7d6ae7da28bf5d1344fcda3c3b4a3e9e830e", "ja": "でも楽しかったですよ。いろんなキャラクターを\n演じるのは、エキサイティングでした！", "zh": "不过还是很开心的。扮演各种角色，真的很刺激！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "6e1c731b5198f3d4eb5dd7653054dca381c36fc3eac0533a5d8ce4dec109b8de", "ja": "いいエクスペリエンスにもなったと思います♪\n気持ちをスイッチして、色々な役をやって……。", "zh": "也是很棒的体验♪\n切换心情去饰演各种各样的角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3df005bbc82f1991899f62083be174466cebcea5a933542bc5d97a30b1d56232", "ja": "思えば、あの世界の住人のほとんどが\nロコだったしな。ロコズワールド、って感じだったよ。", "zh": "回想起来，那个世界的居民大半都是\nROCO呢。很有种ROCO世界的感觉哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "76e1932e417afaf5daae080b7d50b41fad16de4d3a1f039d6e0bac3bc1912feb", "ja": "本当ですか！？　えへへ……。\nそう言ってもらえるとハッピーです♪", "zh": "真的吗！？嘿嘿……能听到你这么说，我很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "8a1c4ecbd4cf5ab74bad5534f08ec08d9f2222a8a9cc534419be1475efa10083", "ja": "実は映像の方も、ちょっと意識していたんですよ！\n小道具として、ロコアートを持ち込んだり……。", "zh": "其实影像那方面，我也稍微留了点心哦！\n比如作为小道具，带了ROCO艺术进去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "5cd3a96da1a362c0de204c92b8171c7544a1450256efc2404d7f49f83d3b71fd", "ja": "スクリーンにほとんど映らないようなところも、\nしっかり作ってあるの！", "zh": "连画面上几乎看不到的地方，也都认真制作了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0233_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "7d5a08bb695e081b1d0af9ee2c7447372d8a4d741f6d6811cca2114c13ca86a2", "ja": "メイキングを知りたいですか？\n遠慮はノーサンクスです！　トークしましょう♪", "zh": "想知道制作过程吗？\n不用客气！我们聊聊吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
